##### REFERENCES
#### Source IRIs are minted, not looked up: "Source-" + uuid5(NAMESPACE_URL, canonical identifier),
#### where the identifier is the best one available (DOI > arXiv > ISBN > canonical URL > "urn:x-title:" + lowercased title).
#### The same source therefore always gets the same IRI, so citations across episodes merge.
#### Once minted, an IRI stays put: a better identifier found later is added as a link, not used to re-mint.
